  )
  (text "POWER :  5 V from PC USB (shares PC ground -> no ground loop)      電源與接地" (at 184.15 26.67 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0738b63b-5015-40a8-b9fb-4048bd9f60d5)
  )
  (no_connect (at 200.66 50.8) (uuid c512956e-1c24-4376-a65c-d70e6d9f0af5))
  (no_connect (at 200.66 53.34) (uuid b193eeb6-c879-47ec-9d17-b80f54ce5768))
  (text "D+ / D- unused: power only.\nFB1 + C14: HF filter on USB 5 V." (at 208.28 83.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6b17f97b-7665-42a1-a0f2-40df5dbb35aa)
  )
  (rectangle (start 182.88 99.06) (end 279.4 193.04)
    (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none))
    (uuid 4bd9118e-c31c-42fb-80ff-45b09fcf6085)
  )
  (text "NOTES      設計說明" (at 184.15 97.79 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 531b43c4-9563-4eb5-998d-4152948c3ce8)
  )
  (text "1. RJ9 (4P4C) pinout is NOT standardized. Measure first:\n   - receiver pair: 30~300 ohm DC; electret mic pair: diode-like (asymmetric).\n   - set JP1-JP4 (pair) and JP5-JP6 (mic polarity) to match the handset.\n2. Path A: LM386 has low output impedance, so the receiver no longer\n   loads the PC line out -> no volume drop. RV1 sets the level.\n   Gain fixed at 20 (pins 1/8 open). C5 blocks the 2.5 V DC offset.\n   R3 limits current into the receiver (telephone receiver ~1 mW rated).\n3. Path B: electret needs 2~5 V bias via R5. Mic level ~10 mV -> line\n   level ~300 mV needs ~30 dB; set with RV2. Output impedance ~100 ohm\n   drives the 10 kohm line in without loss.\n   Dynamic mic instead of electret: remove R5, raise gain (2 stages).\n4. Ground: everything is powered from the same PC USB port -> single\n   ground reference. Star ground on PCB; keep U2 away from U1 output.\n   R6/C7 filter USB switching noise for the mic preamp (+5V_FILT).\n5. Optional sidetone: 47k~100k from U2A output to RV1 pin 1.\n6. Optional LDO (e.g. 4.5 V) in place of R6 if USB noise is still audible.\n7. SMT: R/C 0805; 10uF/22uF = 1206 X5R 10V ceramic; 47pF = C0G;\n   U1/U2 = SOIC-8; RV2 = Bourns 3314J SMT trimmer; FB1 = 0805 bead.\n   THT (connectors + panel pot): J1/J3 = CUI SJ1-3523N 3.5 mm jack,\n   J2 = Evercom 5301-440 RJ9, J4 = Lumberg 2411 02 USB-B,\n   RV1 = Alps RK097 single 9 mm right-angle shaft pot.\n8. C5/C7/C14 = SMD V-chip electrolytic 6.3 mm, >= 6.3 V rating." (at 185.42 101.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid bcc89ff3-2fa2-4e47-aa52-1eab8debdc87)
  )
  (rectangle (start 17.78 210.82) (end 167.64 284.48)
    (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none))
    (uuid f6749692-c160-415c-aa93-cdc3f4701797)
  )
