  (text "JP1-JP4 = PAIR select (always set all four the same way)\n   1-2 (default): J2.1 = EAR+, J2.4 = EAR-/GND, J2.2 = MA, J2.3 = MB\n   2-3          : J2.2 = EAR+, J2.3 = EAR-/GND, J2.1 = MA, J2.4 = MB\nJP5-JP6 = MIC polarity (always set both the same way)\n   1-2 (default): MA = MIC+ (hot), MB = GND\n   2-3          : MA = GND, MB = MIC+ (hot)\nTo change: cut the 1-2 trace on the jumper, then bridge 2-3 with solder." (at 22.86 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 05003729-a5a2-42eb-bd52-8723c5678e23)
  )
